        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-04T16:53:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So what would you suggest for all of us who are in this situation, Paul?&nbsp; My cards are probably only a millimeter or so off, but that's enough to make all the PtLs in Tachyon's deck instantly visible, and I see that as being a problem, so for the moment I'm not using the errata cards.</p>",
