        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jagarciao/{size}/2010_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-04T17:21:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If imagine the only options available right now would be to either not use the cards altogether, use them by proxie (that is, keep the old cards in the deck but refer to the new text them when they come up), or buy a replacement deck for the affected decks.&nbsp;</p>",
