        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/c77e96/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-05T16:46:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You buy 100 sleeves for a dollar and just sleave the one deck you have issues with. You'd then have sleeves left over for another character if you had a similar issue. Also, sleeves work well for printed promos. Gives them a firmer texture if you printed them on regular paper.</p>",
