        "cooked": "<p>My errata cards finally arrived this morning (they were on the slowest boat from St. Louis to California, apparently). &nbsp;The cards are slightly smaller than the rest in my decks, but I'm certain my wife and daughter will never notice if I don't mention it, so I'm just going to use them.</p>",
