        "created_at": "2014-01-13T04:32:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was wrong. &nbsp;The first thing my wife noticed upon shuffling the Tachyon deck was how some of the cards didn't shuffle right with the rest of them. &nbsp;Now she's making me pull them out and put the old ones back in. &nbsp;Le sigh. &nbsp;I guess the errata cards aren't as useful as I'd hoped.</p>",
